  "stem": "如图，\\(OC\\)是\\(\\angle AOB\\)的平分线，\\(\\angle BOD=\\frac { 1 } { 3 }\\angle COD\\)，\\(\\angle BOD=15{}^\\circ\\)，则\\(\\angle BOC=\\)___________，\\(\\angle AOB=\\)___________．\n〔图1〕",
